,"resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0236","ي س ر","B002","root_001694","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0237","ي ق ن","B001","root_001696","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0238","ي م ن","B001","root_001698","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0239","ي م ن","B002","root_001698","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0240","ي م ن","B003","root_001698","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0241","ي م ن","B004","root_001698","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s074-0242","ي و م","B003","root_001700","B003","resolved_source_exact"]],"review_columns":["anchor_key","source_path","line","ayah_ref","raw_excerpt"],"review_rows":[["a-s074-0002","v12/runs_11ayah/s074/full_context_control/reader_s074_a_ayah_walk.md",19,"74:1","2. **The outer wrap becomes the first layer in a material purification mechanism.** B002 specifically places the `دثار` over an inner garment; 74:4 then makes garments (`ث و ب` B003, clothing and the self as garment) the object of cleansing. The packet supplies two distinct clothing images and an intervening public commission; I infer that removing or transcending the outer layer enables the garment/self to become publicly serviceable. On this reading, \"the wrapped one\" marks an initial layered state that the following commands progressively reorganize."],["a-s074-0001","v12/runs_11ayah/s074/full_context_control/reader_s074_a_ayah_walk.md",55,"74:4","2. **Cleansing is a prerequisite for sustained warning under pressure.** The command sits between magnifying the Lord (74:3) and restraint for the Lord (74:7), with the difficult event introduced at 74:8-9. Purity B001/B005 therefore receives the assigned role of reducing internal contradiction before warning and endurance. The packet supplies sequence, not causality; I infer purification -> coherence under later strain. The ayah reads as operational preparation, not decorative purity."],["a-s074-0005","v12/runs_11ayah/s074/full_context_control/reader_s074_a_ayah_walk.md",55,"74:4","2. **Cleansing is a prerequisite for sustained warning under pressure.** The command sits between magnifying the Lord (74:3) and restraint for the Lord (74:7), with the difficult event introduced at 74:8-9. Purity B001/B005 therefore receives the assigned role of reducing internal contradiction before warning and endurance. The packet supplies sequence, not causality; I infer purification -> coherence under later strain. The ayah reads as operational preparation, not decorative purity."],["a-s074-0004","v12/runs_11ayah/s074/full_context_control/reader_s074_a_ayah_walk.md",477,"74:39","2. **Later practices give the compact title an ethical-social interior.** 74:43 contrasts non-membership among those who pray, and 74:44 contrasts failure to feed the poor. Both lie within the focus window. The fixed `أَصْحَاب` assigns companionship the role of durable cohort identity, while `يَمِين` B004 supplies rightful agency. The packet supplies title and contrasts; I infer prayer plus provision-sharing -> visible form of right-associated belonging. The verse's brevity becomes a compressed social category whose contours emerge from what the opposing group lacked."],["a-s074-0003","v12/runs_11ayah/s074/full_context_control/reader_s074_a_ayah_walk.md",513,"74:42","2. **The second-person object makes entry something done through them and to them.** The root's B003 image is a straight thrust directly forward, while `فِى` names the enclosing destination. The answer's parallel first-person plurals show sustained forward continuation in non-prayer, non-feeding, wading, and denial. The packet supplies grammatical object, direct-motion branch, and cumulative habits; I infer habits providing momentum -> subjects carried into their enclosing result. This does not erase agency; it exposes the route as both enacted and eventually compelling."]]}
